  "subjectRule": "ForumNeed.subject is the SEA pubkey the need is about. It is not compared to the forum id and not compared to the principal embedded in the forum id.",
  "offerRule": "stated 1 on an offer is live. stated 0 is withdrawn by the helper or cancelled by the need owner or subject. Check see on the need gates the post. Accepting one live offer sets accepted_offer and stated 0. Accept reads the live offer stored when that helper posted it. A caller-supplied offer that was not posted is refused, and the helper must still pass Check see. A resolved need refuses withdrawal of the offer it names. Only the owner reopens, and that clears accepted_offer. Earlier offers stay. body and severity stay as posted. Resolve does not elect. A hop, a status node, a chat tag, and a hint do not mint.",
